          "from": "Attic ἥλιος /hɛ̌ː.li.os/ 'sun'",
          "to": "/ˈi.li.os/ (4th c. CE)",
          "note": "Psilosis: initial /h/ (rough breathing) was lost by the Koine period."
        },
        {
          "from": "Attic ὁδός /ho.dós/ 'road'",
          "to": "/oˈðos/ (4th c. CE), Modern Greek οδός"
